{
	"_comment": "Vectors of the update-check window's host contract and of the exhausted GitHub rate limit, replayed by _shared/lua/updater/check_session.lua and updater/rate_limit.lua (macOS and Linux, _shared/lua/test/check_session_contract.lua) and by the Windows host (windows/ui/update_check/init.ahk, modules/updater/core.ahk). answers: the window's answer per phase; checking is no answer yet. actions: the phases in which an action reaches its effect, for the answers below (a switch needs a channel its answer lists, which a failure's does not). state_messages: the fields the page receives for an answer; a field absent from expect may be anything, and a name in absent must not be sent. rate_limit: the sentence of a final response, \"\" when it is not an exhausted limit.",
